            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Extending [cpython/bytes.pxd](https://github.com/cython/cython/blob/1f7e6ddaf16c7087a366dc9a9508b09c682fa0a3/Cython/Includes/cpython/bytes.pxd) to include the new APIs\n\nWe should definitely do this. And also for `PyUnicodeWriter` which was made public in 3.14.\n\n> Changing internal code to use the Python 3.15 path when appropriate (new enough version & currently not stable ABI IIUC)\n\nI couldn't find anywhere that would obviously benefit from this. But I'm not opposed to it if you or anyone else can do a better search than me.\n",
