            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Yeah agree that one is probably not concerning. Even [the docs]( https://docs.python.org/3/c-api/bytes.html#c.PyBytes_FromStringAndSize ) imply they are more interested in a non-`0` length\n\n> *[Soft deprecated]( https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-soft-deprecated ) since version 3.15*: Use the [`PyBytesWriter`]( https://docs.python.org/3/c-api/bytes.html#c.PyBytesWriter ) API instead of `PyBytes_FromStringAndSize(NULL, len)`\n\nGotcha. So a change will need some benchmarking as well. Added this to the OP.",
